      · Height was `items.length * 30` — a guess. A button is 6px padding on 13px
        text and a long label WRAPS, so the fourteen-entry JOB menu is taller than
        the guess and its bottom rows went under the window edge.
      · Width was a flat 150. `GUARD ANNOTATOR MERRICK (3)` is not 150px wide, so
        menus opened near the right edge ran off it (measured: bottom 839 in an
        800px window).
      · And BOTH clamps were `Math.min` only, with nothing to stop a negative
        result. The JOB list deliberately opens upward from a button at the foot of
        the character panel, so on a short window it was placed at top -40 — the
